{
  "id": "2SA.24",
  "number": "24",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Samueli 24",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu waatsukirirwa tsona Aiziraeli, na achimchenga-chenga Daudi akale chinyume chao. Achimuamba, “Phiya ukaaolange atu osi awezao kupiga viha a Iziraeli na a Juda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo mfalume achimuambira Joabu, mkpwulu wa jeshi ariyekala phamwenga naye achimuamba, “Phiyani kpwa mbari zosi za Iziraeli, hangu Dani hadi Beeri-Sheba, mkaaolange atu niphahe kumanya kala ni angaphi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Joabu achimuamba mfalume, “Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlunguo naajalie Aiziraeli aenjerezeke akale kano gana zaidi kuriko vira arivyo sambi. Nawe bwana wangu mfalume urione dzambo hiri na matsogo mwenye ela phahi, kpwa utu wani bwana wangu mfalume ukafwahirwa ni kuhenda dzambo hiro?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela neno ra mfalume rakala na nguvu kuriko ra Joabu na akulu a jeshi. Phahi Joabu na akulu a jeshi auka mbere za mfalume achiphiya kpwendaaolanga ro jeshi ra Aiziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avuka muho Joridani, achichita kambi phephi na Aroeri, uphande wa mwakani kpwenye dete. Kula hipho atsupira Gadi na achiphiya uphande wa vurini hadi achifika mudzi wa Jazeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha aphiya Giliadi hadi Kadeshi hiko tsi ya Ahiti chisha aphiya Dani, na kula Dani achizunguluka hadi Sidoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achedza mudzi uriodzengerwa ngome wa Tiro na midzi yosi ya Ahivi, Akanani na achiphiya Beeri-Sheba, uphande wa mwakani mwa Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ariphomala kuzunguluka tsi yosi, auya Jerusalemu bada ya miezi tisiya na siku mirongo miiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Joabu achimphirikira mfalume isabu ya hinyo atu. Hiko Iziraeli kala kuna masujaa amanyao kupigana kpwa kuhumira upanga elufu magana manane awezao kuhumira panda na hiko Juda kala kuna alume elufu magana matsano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela bada ya kuaolanga hinyo atu wakala na wasiwasi sana moyoni. Ndipho achimuambira Mwenyezi Mlungu, “Nchigohenda ni dambi kulu sana ela phahi nakuvoya, ee Mwenyezi Mlungu, uniswamehe mimi mtumishio kpwa mana nkahenda dzambo ra chizuzu sana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligundzu kuriphocha Daudi aripholamuka, Mwenyezi Mlungu wamupha ujumbe nabii Gadi, muonadzi wa Daudi, kuamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Phiya ukamuambire Daudi, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anakuamba hivi: Nakupha mambo mahahu utsambule mwenga ambaro ndakuhendera.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Gadi waphiya kpwa Daudi, achendamuamba, “Undatsambula riphi kahi ya higa: ndzala ya muda wa miaka sabaa ikale kpwenye tsiiyo? Au miezi mihahu ya kuachimbira avihao kuno anakuzoresa? Au siku tahu ambapho hino tsi indainjirwa ni ukongo mui? Sambi fikiri ukate shauri uniphe jibu ra kumuuyizira iye achiyenihuma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi achimuamba Gadi, “Nkainjira kpwenye mashaka makulu, baha hutiywe adabu ni Mwenyezi Mlungu, mana mbazize ni nyinji, ela usiniriche nkatiywa mikononi mwa anadamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Mwenyezi Mlungu wareha ukongo mui Iziraeli, hangu ligundzu hadi muda uriokala ukapangbwa. Atu elufu mirongo sabaa achifwa kahi ya tsi yosi kula Dani hadi Beeri-Sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hiye malaika ariphogolosa mkpwonowe kuelekeza Jerusalemu ili aangamize hinyo atu, Mwenyezi Mlungu waonera mbazi kpwa sababu ya higo mai, achimuambira hiye malaika mwenye kurehera atu ukongo mui, “Ikatosha, ndipho uyiza mkpwonoo.” Na hiye malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu kala aimire phephi na phatu pha kuwagira mtsere pha Arauna, Mjebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ariphomuona malaika ariyekala anaolaga atu kpwa kuarehera ukongo mui, wagomba na Mwenyezi Mlungu achiamba, “Lola, mimi ndimi niriyekosa, ni mimi niriyekosera. Ela gano mangʼondzi gakahendani? Phahi nitiya adabu mimi na nyumba ya baba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku iyo-iyo Gadi waphiya kpwa Daudi, achendamuamba, “Haya! Ambuka ukamdzengere Mwenyezi Mlungu phatu pha kulavira sadaka, kahi ya phatu pha kuwagira mtsere pha Arauna, Mjebusi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Daudi waambuka dza vyo Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyomlagiza kutsupira neno rogombwa ni Gadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiye Arauna ariphotsupha dzitso uphande wa tsini wamuona mfalume aredza na atumishie. Arauna watuluka achendamzamira mfalume hadi chilangu chichiguta photsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiuza, “Kpwa utu wani Bwana wangu mfalume akamtsolokera mtumishiwe?” Naye Daudi achijibu achiamba, “Nkedzagula hichi chiwanjacho cha kuwagira mtsere nimdzengere Mwenyezi Mlungu phatu pha kulavira sadaka, ili nyo ukongo mui urio na atu usire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arauna achimuamba Daudi, “Bwana wangu mfalume, hala chikufwahiracho ukalavire sadaka. Lola, mino nalavya ndzau akale sadaka ya kuochwa, na vifwaya vya kuwagira na magogolo ga ngʼombe gakale kuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vitu hivi vyosi, ee mfalume, mino nkakupha uwe.” Arauna achienderera kuamba, “Natumai Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlunguo andakukubali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mfalume achimuamba Arauna, “Hata! Uwe usiniphe chochosi. Mino ni nigule chila chitu kpwa samaniye. Sindamlavira Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wangu, sadaka za kuochwa ambazo tazikanigarimu.” Hipho mfalume Daudi wagula hicho chiwanja cha kuwagira mtsere na hinyo ndzau kpwa vipande mirongo mitsano vya feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Daudi wamdzengera Mwenyezi Mlungu phatu pha kulavira sadaka phapho na achimlavira sadaka za kuochwa na sadaka za amani. Phahi Mwenyezi Mlungu wagakubali higo mavoyo kpwa ajili ya yo tsi, naye achiausira nyo ukongo mui urioaphaha atu a Iziraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
